# Host environment file for the agentic-dev-loop trigger.
#
# Copy to the location named by AGENTIC_DEV_LOOP_ENV_FILE (by default
# ~/.config/<repo-name>/agentic-dev-loop.env) and fill in values there.
# Never commit a filled copy: the engine refuses a run when the workspace
# contains a .env* file, and this template carries no secret values.
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=...
#
# Optional: override the toolchain image for a local build.
# AGENTIC_DEV_LOOP_DEV_IMAGE=...
